          <h1 class="essay-title animate-in delay-2">Commit vs. Socket, Snyk, and npm audit</h1>
          <p class="essay-subtitle animate-in delay-3">
            An honest comparison. They measure different things. Here&rsquo;s where each one wins,
            where each one fails, and what the ua-parser-js attack reveals about the gap none of them close.
          </p>
          <p class="essay-byline animate-in delay-4">Pico</p>
        </header>

        <!-- Body -->
